---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Matériel de pêche à la mouche pour le brochet — Jean-Baptiste Vidal"
  description="Cannes puissantes, soies et grosses mouches pour la pêche du brochet à la mouche. SAGE Payload, Rio Elite Predator. Recommandations du guide Jean-Baptiste Vidal."
>

  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="mat-hero">
    <div class="mat-hero__bg"></div>
    <div class="mat-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="mat-hero__content container">
      <p class="mat-eyebrow">Matériel · Brochet · Prédateur</p>
      <h1>Matériel de pêche à la mouche<br /><span class="mat-hero__sub">pour le brochet</span></h1>
      <p class="mat-lead">Cannes puissance 9–10, soies prédateurs et grosses mouches volumineuses — le choix de Jean-Baptiste pour chasser le grand brochet en lac et en étang.</p>
      <div class="mat-hero__cta">
        <a href="/peche-du-brochet-a-la-mouche" class="btn-prim">Pêche du brochet</a>
        <a href="/materiel-jeanbaptistevidal" class="btn-ghost">← Tout le matériel</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ ÉQUIPEMENT ═══ -->
  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Équipement recommandé</p>
      <h2>Ce qu'il faut dans la boîte</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Le brochet exige un matériel solide, capable de lancer de grosses mouches volumineuses par tous les temps. Voici les choix de Jean-Baptiste, utilisés en guidage sur le Lac Saint-Michel et les étangs bretons.</p>

      <div class="mat-cards">

        <div class="mat-card">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Canne</span>
          <h3>La canne — puissance 9 à 10</h3>
          <p>Une <strong>puissance 9 à 10</strong> est indispensable pour lancer les grosses mouches volumineuses utilisées pour le brochet. La <strong>SAGE Payload</strong> est spécialement conçue pour les grosses mouches, avec une action en boucle ouverte qui soulage considérablement les lancers en journée.</p>
          <p>La <strong>SAGE Maverick</strong> est une excellente alternative, puissante et polyvalente, efficace aussi bien pour le brochet que pour le bar.</p>
          <a href="https://www.ardentflyfishing.com/fr/p/28552-canne-a-mouche-sage-payload-89-soie-9.html"
             class="mat-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" width="15" height="15"><path d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z"/></svg>
            Acheter la SAGE Payload sur Ardent →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mat-card">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Soie</span>
          <h3>La soie — fuseau décentré</h3>
          <p>Des soies à <strong>fuseau décentré</strong> pour lancer de grosses mouches sans effort. La <strong>Rio Elite Predator</strong> est le choix premium : tête courte idéale en espace restreint sur le bateau, profil optimisé contre le vent.</p>
          <p>Prévoir <strong>trois densités</strong> : flottante (surface), intermédiaire (la plus utilisée) et plongeante rapide (automne/hiver en profondeur).</p>
          <a href="https://www.ardentflyfishing.com/fr/p/29497-soie-rio-elite-predator-wf-f.html"
             class="mat-card__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" width="15" height="15"><path d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z"/></svg>
            Acheter la Rio Elite Predator sur Ardent →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mat-card">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Bas de ligne · Avançon</span>
          <h3>Le bas de ligne</h3>
          <p>Le bas de ligne doit rester le plus simple possible : <strong>un ou deux brins maximum</strong>. Un avançon en <strong>acier ou titane</strong> est indispensable — sans lui, la coupure par les dents du brochet est inévitable.</p>
          <p>Rio propose une excellente gamme d'avançons en acier tressé multi-brin, souples et discrets. Pour les petits sujets uniquement, un <strong>fluorocarbone 60°+</strong> peut suffire.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ MOUCHES ═══ -->
  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="flies-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Mouches à brochet</p>
          <h2>Les patterns indispensables</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">Une grande sélection est nécessaire pour s'adapter aux conditions et aux humeurs du brochet. Je monte moi-même la majorité de mes mouches.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.ardentflyfishing.com/fr/c/1094-brochet"
           class="shop-link-big" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" width="18" height="18"><path d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z"/></svg>
          Mouches brochet sur Ardent
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mat-cards mat-cards--3">
        <div class="mat-card mat-card--fly">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Surface</span>
          <h3>Mouches de surface</h3>
          <p><strong>Gurglers, poppers, sliders</strong> — les prises en surface sont les plus spectaculaires. Idéal en bordure dans les herbiers et sous les frondaisons, printemps et début d'été.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mat-card mat-card--fly">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Streamers imitatifs</span>
          <h3>Streamers imitatifs</h3>
          <p>Imitations de perches, gardons et autres poissons-appâts locaux. Les patterns en <strong>marabou et craft fur</strong> donnent un mouvement naturel irrésistible. Tailles 3/0 à 6/0.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mat-card mat-card--fly">
          <span class="mat-card__tag">Streamers attractants</span>
          <h3>Streamers attractants</h3>
          <p>Couleurs vives — <strong>chartreuse, orange, rouge/blanc</strong> — pour les eaux colorées ou turbides. Deceiver et Clouser géants pour les grands plans d'eau.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CARROUSEL PHOTOS ═══ -->
  <section class="voy-carousel-section">
    <div class="voy-carousel" id="mb-carousel">
      <div class="voy-carousel__track" id="mb-track">
        {[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9].map((n, i) => (
          <div class="voy-carousel__slide">
            <img src={`/images/MB%20${n}.avif`} alt={`Matériel brochet — photo ${n}`} loading={i === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'} />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <button class="voy-carousel__btn voy-carousel__btn--prev" id="mb-prev" aria-label="Photo précédente">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="20" height="20"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="voy-carousel__btn voy-carousel__btn--next" id="mb-next" aria-label="Photo suivante">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="20" height="20"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
      </button>
      <div class="voy-carousel__counter" id="mb-counter">1 / 9</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ LIENS SOUS-PAGES ═══ -->
  <section class="section mat-subnav-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Tout le matériel</h2>
      <div class="mat-sublinks">
        <a href="/materiel-mouche-migrateur" class="mat-sublink">Matériel migrateurs</a>
        <a href="/materiel-mouche-truite" class="mat-sublink">Matériel truite</a>
        <a href="/materiel-mouche-bar" class="mat-sublink">Matériel bar</a>
        <a href="/materiel-mouche-reservoir" class="mat-sublink">Matériel réservoir</a>
        <a href="/materiel-mouche-peche-exotique" class="mat-sublink">Matériel exotique</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CTA FINAL ═══ -->
  <section class="prest-cta-final section section--dark">
    <div class="container prest-cta-final__inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Sortie brochet à la mouche</h2>
        <p>Guidage spécialisé brochet — disponibilités et tarifs sur demande.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prest-cta-final__btns">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-prim">Me contacter</a>
        <a href="tel:0687303456" class="btn-ghost-light">06 87 30 34 56</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<script>
;(function() {
  const carousel = document.getElementById('mb-carousel')
  const track    = document.getElementById('mb-track')
  const prevBtn  = document.getElementById('mb-prev')
  const nextBtn  = document.getElementById('mb-next')
  const counter  = document.getElementById('mb-counter')
  if (!track || !carousel) return

  const total = track.querySelectorAll('.voy-carousel__slide').length
  let current = 0, timer = null

  function slideW() { return (carousel.offsetWidth - 6) / 3 }
  function calcOffset(idx) {
    const w = slideW()
    return Math.max(0, Math.min((total - 3) * (w + 3), (idx - 1) * (w + 3)))
  }

  function go(idx) {
    current = (idx + total) % total
    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${calcOffset(current)}px)`
    if (counter) counter.textContent = `${current + 1} / ${total}`
  }

  function stopAutoplay()    { clearInterval(timer); timer = null }
  function startAutoplay()   { if (!timer) timer = setInterval(() => go(current + 1), 4000) }
  function restartAutoplay() { stopAutoplay(); setTimeout(startAutoplay, 6000) }

  prevBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => { go(current - 1); restartAutoplay() })
  nextBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => { go(current + 1); restartAutoplay() })

  carousel.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAutoplay)
  carousel.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAutoplay)

  window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
    track.style.transition = 'none'
    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${calcOffset(current)}px)`
    requestAnimationFrame(() => { track.style.transition = '' })
  })

  // Swipe tactile
  let startX = 0
  carousel.addEventListener('touchstart', e => { startX = e.touches[0].clientX }, { passive: true })
  carousel.addEventListener('touchend', e => {
    const dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX
    if (Math.abs(dx) > 40) { go(current + (dx < 0 ? 1 : -1)); restartAutoplay() }
  }, { passive: true })

  // Drag souris
  let dragStartX = 0, dragging = false
  carousel.addEventListener('mousedown', e => { dragStartX = e.clientX; dragging = true })
  carousel.addEventListener('mouseup', e => {
    if (!dragging) return; dragging = false
    const dx = e.clientX - dragStartX
    if (Math.abs(dx) > 40) { go(current + (dx < 0 ? 1 : -1)); restartAutoplay() }
  })
  carousel.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { dragging = false })

  startAutoplay()
})()
</script>

<style>
  /* ── HERO ── */
  .mat-hero {
    position: relative; min-height: 72vh;
    display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding-bottom: 4rem;
    color: white; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .mat-hero__bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: url('/images/BR%201.avif') center / cover no-repeat;
    background-color: var(--color-ocean);
  }
  .mat-hero__overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(7,24,31,0.88) 0%, rgba(13,43,62,0.45) 60%, rgba(13,43,62,0.3) 100%);
  }
  .mat-hero__content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .mat-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ocean-light); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .mat-hero__content h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 400; color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 680px;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .mat-hero__sub {
    display: block; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 300; opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .mat-lead {
    font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .mat-hero__cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-prim {
    background: var(--color-ocean-main); color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.95rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-prim:hover { background: #144b72; }
  .btn-ghost {
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.95rem; text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: white; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

  /* ── GLOBALS ── */
  .section--white { background: #fff; }
  .section--sand  { background: var(--color-sand); }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ocean-main); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted, #555);
    max-width: 680px; margin: 0.75rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ── MAT CARDS ── */
  .mat-cards {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .mat-card {
    background: var(--color-sand); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem 2rem 1.8rem;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-ocean-main);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .mat-card--fly { background: white; }
  .mat-card__tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ocean-main); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .mat-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .mat-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-muted, #555); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .mat-card p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .mat-card__link {
    margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.2rem;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--color-ocean-main); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-ocean-main);
    padding-bottom: 1px; transition: opacity 0.2s; width: fit-content;
  }
  .mat-card__link:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

  /* ── FLIES HEADER ── */
  .flies-header {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .shop-link-big {
    flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--color-ocean-main); color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap; align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .shop-link-big:hover { background: #144b72; }

  /* ── CARROUSEL ── */
  .voy-carousel-section { background: var(--color-ocean); overflow: hidden; }
  .voy-carousel { position: relative; overflow: hidden; cursor: grab; }
  .voy-carousel:active { cursor: grabbing; }
  .voy-carousel__track {
    display: flex; align-items: stretch;
    transition: transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    will-change: transform; gap: 3px;
  }
  .voy-carousel__slide {
    flex: 0 0 calc((100% - 6px) / 3);
    width: calc((100% - 6px) / 3);
    aspect-ratio: 3/2; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .voy-carousel__slide img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center;
    display: block; user-select: none; -webkit-user-drag: none;
  }
  .voy-carousel__btn {
    position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer; z-index: 10; padding: 0;
    transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .voy-carousel__btn:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .voy-carousel__btn--prev { left: 1rem; }
  .voy-carousel__btn--next { right: 1rem; }
  .voy-carousel__counter {
    position: absolute; bottom: 0.85rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 10;
    font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* ── SUB-NAV ── */
  .mat-subnav-section { background: var(--color-sand); }
  .mat-subnav-section h2 { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .mat-sublinks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
  .mat-sublink {
    background: white; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-ocean-main);
    color: var(--color-ocean-main); padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .mat-sublink:hover { background: var(--color-ocean-main); color: white; }

  /* ── CTA FINAL ── */
  .prest-cta-final__inner {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .prest-cta-final__inner h2 { color: white; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .prest-cta-final__inner > div:first-child p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); }
  .prest-cta-final__btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-ghost-light {
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color: white;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.95rem; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost-light:hover { border-color: white; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .mat-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .flies-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }
    .voy-carousel__slide { flex: 0 0 calc((100% - 3px) / 2); width: calc((100% - 3px) / 2); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .voy-carousel__slide { flex: 0 0 100%; width: 100%; }
    .voy-carousel__btn { width: 38px; height: 38px; }
    .voy-carousel__btn--prev { left: 0.75rem; }
    .voy-carousel__btn--next { right: 0.75rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .mat-hero { min-height: 85vh; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
    .prest-cta-final__inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
